.DS_Store
._*
.claude/worktrees/
presence-server/node_modules/
presence-server/.wrangler/

# Lemo source spritesheets — 197 MB of 2048² cells. Only the sliced/downscaled
# Art/Lemo/Sheets/*.png (~950 KB) ship; keep the masters out of git history.
Art/Lemo/*.png
# reff.png is small and is where the spawn/wander coords were measured — keep it.
!Art/Lemo/reff.png
# A PNG-sequence master (the Throw clip's 111 frames, 115 MB) — slice.py bakes it
# into Art/Lemo/Sheets/Throw.webp; the frames never ship.
Art/Lemo/throw/
# …and the ThrowPoints clip's 67 frames (52 MB) → Art/Lemo/Sheets/ThrowPoints.webp.
Art/Lemo/ThrowPoints/

# Fireplace fire source spritesheet (4x8 grid of 1500x1920 cells, ~12 MB) — only the
# sliced Art/Fire/fire_NN.png sequence (~890 KB) ships. Keep the master out of git.
Art/Fireplace Fire.png

# Trophy masters. The shipped set is Art/trophies/*.webp (~190 KB) cropped to the
# painted art out of these 2000² PNGs, and Art/Workspace/Workspace_0013b_Trophy_Shelf.png
# cropped out of the full-canvas world master (also parked in Art/trophies, so the
# pre-commit manifest globber never sees it). Keep them local, like Lemo's.
Art/trophies/*.png
# Trophy_Collect ships trimmed to 25s (4s fade); this is the untouched 111s master.
Sound/Trophy_Collect.full.mp3
# player_Fall ships re-encoded at 128k; this is the 242k original.
Sound/player_Fall.full.mp3
# The two meeting-hall cues ship re-encoded at 96k; these are the originals.
Sound/meeting_start.full.mp3
Sound/meeting_loaded.full.mp3
# ليمو throwing points in the hall ships re-encoded at 96k; this is the original.
Sound/Lemo_ThrowPoints.full.mp3

# Meeting-room + extra-table masters. What ships is Art/Workspace/Extension_*.webp
# (cropped to their painted bbox) and Art/Meeting_Table_Real.webp; the full-canvas
# PNGs are parked in a subfolder so the pre-commit manifest globber never sees them.
Art/Workspace/masters/

# Hat masters (the 1000² originals). What ships is Hats/*.png cropped to the painted
# art and capped at 384px. Parked in a subfolder so the hats.json hook never lists them.
Hats/masters/

# Python bytecode (tools/bake_world.py)
__pycache__/

# Wrangler state when a wrangler command is run from the repo root
.wrangler/

# Output of tools/lemo_prompt.mjs (ليمو's prompt, for a test outside the مقر)
tools/out/
# The two DM cues ship re-encoded at 64k mono; these are the originals.
Sound/Dm_Send.full.mp3
Sound/Dm_Recieve.full.mp3
